| Remote deployment | Cloud-hosted server | ❌ Not available |
| Smithery | Not mentioned | ❌ Not available |
| Docker | Not mentioned | ❌ Not available |

**Available Deployment Option:**
- **Local deployment**: Clone repository → Install dependencies with pip → Install MCP server with `mcp install`

