- Authentication uses `DeviceCodeCredential` which works on Linux
- MCP protocol is platform-agnostic

The macOS mention appears to be about the intended Claude Desktop integration scenario rather than a hard technical limitation. **This Python MCP server can be deployed on Linux.**

