## 1.3 Local Deployment Plan

Since no free-installation (`uvx`/`npx`) option is provided, I will follow the local deployment process:

1. Clone the repository using `git`
2. Install dependencies using `uv sync`
3. Configure environment variables (`.mcp.env`)
4. Start the MCP server using `uv run jenius_mcp.py`

